<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>The overall performance of different MLLMs in judging, compared with human annotations on different organs. ABD, BRE, BRN, CHE, EYE, FOT, GI, HRT, LL, LNG, OC, PC, UL denote abdomen, brain, breast, chest, eye, foot, gastrointestinal tract, heart, lower limb, lung, oral cavity, pelvic cavity, and upper limb, respectively.</figcaption>
