<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div id="p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix for Med-RewardBench</span></p>
</div>
<div id="p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Abstract.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p4.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Prompt templates ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a> presents the prompt templates used in Med-RewardBench.</p>
</div>
<div id="p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p5.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Physician Evaluation Guideline ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a> outlines the physician evaluation guidelines applied during annotation.</p>
</div>
<div id="p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p6.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C An example in Med-RewardBench ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> shows an example of Med-RewardBench in six dimensions.</p>
</div>
<div id="p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p7.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Results for Different Organs ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a> details the results across 13 organs, evaluated along six distinct dimensions.</p>
</div>
<div id="p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p8.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix <a href="#A5" title="Appendix E Results for Different Departments ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></a> details the results across 8 departments, evaluated along six distinct dimensions.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Prompt templates</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The prompt templates for Med-RewardBench consist of a system prompt, a user question, an image, and two candidate answers (A and B), as illustrated in Figure <a href="#A1.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ Appendix A Prompt templates ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F6" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2508.21430v1/prompt.svg" id="A1.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:465/437;" width="465" height="437"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>The default prompt for pairwise comparison.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Physician Evaluation Guideline</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The physician evaluation guideline for Med-RewardBench consist consists of purpose, evaluation procedure, evaluation dimensions, and additional notes, as illustrated in Figure <a href="#A2.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Appendix B Physician Evaluation Guideline ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F7" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2508.21430v1/Physician_Evaluation_Guideline.svg" id="A2.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:636/899;" width="636" height="899"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Annotation guidelines for medical experts.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>An example in Med-RewardBench</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Fig <a href="#A3.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix C An example in Med-RewardBench ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> shows an example of Med-RewardBench  in six dimensions.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2508.21430v1/example.png" id="A3.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:663/405;" width="663" height="405" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>An example of Med-RewardBench in six dimensions.</figcaption>
</figure>
