<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Results for Different Organs</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A5.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix E Results for Different Departments ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> - <a href="#A5.T16" title="Table 16 ‣ Appendix E Results for Different Departments ‣ Med-RewardBench: Benchmarking Reward Models and Judges for Medical Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a> show the details of each organs in six evaluation dimensions. ACC, REL, COM, CRE, RES, OVE denote accuracy, relevance, comprehensiveness, creativity, responsiveness, and overall, respectively.</p>
</div>
</section>
